  "max_tiers": "Max starting salary: 25% of cap for 0-6 years of service, 30% for 7-9, 35% for 10+ (RealGM, Hoops Rumors). Also subject to the 105% of prior salary limit for higher tiers; Rose Rule and Designated Veteran provisions let <7yr players reach 30% and 7-9yr players reach 35% on extensions. FanSided gives 4-6 yrs for 25% (treated as outlier). Dollar max 2025-26 approx 38.66M/46.39M/54.13M (Salary Swish).",
